---
title: Tool loop
---
sequenceDiagram
    actor user as User
    participant agent as Agent
    participant model as Model
    participant tools as Tools
    participant ledger as Ledger
    user->>agent: Ask
    agent->>model: Plan
    model-->>agent: Call tool
    agent->>tools: Search
    tools-->>agent: Passages
    agent->>model: Ground
    model-->>agent: Draft
    agent->>ledger: Record
    ledger-->>agent: Stored
    agent-->>user: Answer
    user->>agent: Follow up
    agent->>model: Revise
